    "description": "The Favorite Pets Management API enables users to efficiently manage their favorite pets within the pet adoption platform. Consumers such as pet adopters and organizations can utilize this endpoint to fetch a list of pets marked as favorites, allowing for easier decision-making during the adoption process. The API retrieves detailed information on selected pets, enhancing user engagement and satisfaction in finding a perfect match. This functionality is particularly valuable for users who frequently revisit their favorite choices before making a final decision.",
